nst bots or compete with other players in online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Kart brings the ultimate racing experience, filled with boosted features, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Unique Courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Tournaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Characters with unique skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Power-Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Levels of Difficulties (Easy, Normal, Hard and Challenge)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Players Multiplayer Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-Chat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401970/extras/b55532e40ed05e28d8b82533fc0a009d.poster.avif?t=1734124508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401970/extras/b55532e40ed05e28d8b82533fc0a009d.webm?t=1734124508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401970/extras/b55532e40ed05e28d8b82533fc0a009d.mp4?t=1734124508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this energetic kart game and drive among the stars using the movements of your HANDS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, strap in, and prepare to embark on an unforgettable journey through the COSMOS! 🌌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN OUR DISCORD = </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401970/extras/3b910f22f05ecc21fed69f9a802982a7.avif?t=1734124508\" width=777 height=249 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An arcade kart rac